\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The stopping rule as a conjunction. Calibration stops only when all four gates hold at once, so a strong overall score cannot buy a failed class, an unmeasured region, or an unowned high-severity risk. Every threshold is project configuration fixed before the sequence is read, and a failed gate reopens the round rather than lowering the bar.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{eq:qd4-stop-gate}{{1}{1}{}{figure.1}{}}
